  "solution": "**Given: **\n\n(2 (1)/(2)+1 (3)/(4)-(1)/(6)) × 16 ÷ 49 is,\n\nConcept used:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/83ad200c05af7ff0a96c689e1309a38eee4e23c73e3e9636ad108a7806b6c852.png] \n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ (5/2 + 7/4 - 1/6) × 16 ÷ 49 \n\n⇒ ((30 + 21 -2) / 12) × 16 ÷ 49 \n\n⇒ (49 / 12) × 16 ÷ 49\n\n⇒ 49 / 12 × 16 / 49\n\n⇒ 16 / 12 \n\n⇒ 4 / 3\n\n ⇒ 1 (1)/(3)\n\n**∴ The correct answer is 1 (1)/(3)**.",
